node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo/

# Design-hook cache. Rewritten on every run, never authored.
**/.impeccable/

coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The repositioning pack is an input, not a deliverable. Its canonical documents
# are vendored under docs/repositioning/; this is the copy that gets dropped in
# the working tree when it is handed over, and it is never committed.
navirox-repositioning-pack/

# Native build output. The generated projects themselves are committed once an
# app exists; their build products never are.
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/local.properties

# Visual benchmark run output. The committed evidence is the JSON report under
# docs/evidence/, which names the artifact directory, the capture verdicts and
# the reasons a capture was unavailable. The capture images and the generated
# review pages are rewritten on every run, so the whole directory stays local.
# The pattern needs the leading **/ to match the package-level path: a pattern
# with a slash and no leading ** is anchored to the repository root.
**/scenario-artifacts/
